Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:14:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Day 1 setup: include every router, CORS, contract stubs,
 .env.example

- main.py: rename the app object to `app` (so `uvicorn app.main:app` works),
  add CORS for port 5173 on localhost and private LAN addresses, and
  include every router so nobody else has to edit main.py
- Stub routers: users, groups, messages, metrics, ws, stream
- Stub repositories with the contract signatures: user, group, message
- schemas/__init__.py documenting the schemas package
- Fix login: JWT "sub" is now the user_id, which verify_access_token expects
  (it was the username, so every protected endpoint crashed with a 500)
- .env.example with every key; requirements.txt adds pytest and httpx

